<!--
This configuration file allows you to override parameters from config.cpp of TerjeCore-based mods without modding.
Its automatically synchronized with the clients when connecting to the server, so a large size of this file (more than 1MB except comments)
can negatively affect the connection time of players to the server. Use this file for testing purposes,
or if you don't have any ability or modding knowledges to override mod parameters in config.cpp from your own mod.

Please read https://github.com/TerjeBruoygard/TerjeModsScripting/blob/master/Wiki/en/Modding/README.md
To see the full list of supported parameters

Below are examples of rewriting different types of parameters

